  "statement": "Given `n` **positive** integers and a limit `K`, count the contiguous non-empty subarrays whose sum is **at most `K`**.\n\n**Input.** First line `n K`. Second line the `n` integers.\n\n**Output.** One integer.\n\n**Example.**\n\nInput:\n```\n4 5\n1 2 3 4\n```\nOutput:\n```\n6\n```",
